==Strategy==
The Doge Darks in this stage are a double-edged sword. On one hand, they give lots of money to prepare for the wave of Dagshunds. On the other hand, they add additional support, shielding the Dagshunds from your units. The Dagshunds, with their [[Area Attack]] and supporting Doge Darks, are capable of quickly pushing toward your base.

Meatshields are especially important on this stage as they are very effective against the Doge Darks and Dagshunds. Units that outrange the Dagshunds can make quick work of them. If you have him, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is capable of killing all three Dagshunds in one attack, given he is at level 20 and all [[Legendary Cat Sword]] Treasures are maxed out. It may be preferable to stall the Doge Darks at the beginning as it will allow you to build up extra cash.

